  "goodToKnow": "Die Schwarzarbeit is undeclared work, paid cash without tax or social security, common in construction, cleaning and private renovation. In Germany, the customs service's Finanzkontrolle Schwarzarbeit checks workplaces. Schwarz often means illegal: schwarzfahren (fare dodging), Schwarzgeld (undeclared money), der Schwarzmarkt. Paying a tradesman cash without a bill, ohne Rechnung, is also illegal. It has no plural."
